# Copy All Tab URLs

A Chrome extension to copy all open tab URLs to the clipboard.

## Features

- Copies URLs of all open tabs in the current window.
- Easy-to-use popup interface.

## Installation

1. Download or clone the repository.
2. Go to `chrome://extensions/` in your browser.
3. Enable "Developer mode".
4. Click "Load unpacked" and select the extension folder.

## Usage

1. Click the extension icon in the Chrome toolbar.
2. In the popup, click the button to copy all tab URLs.
3. Paste the copied URLs wherever you need.

## Permissions

- `tabs`: Access open tabs.
- `clipboardWrite`: Copy URLs to clipboard.
- `scripting`: Run scripts in the browser.

